{"thread":{"threadID":3460,"boardID":227,"topic":"Recording the Range","time":1459002407,"userID":2147,"username":"Doo Doo","lastPostTime":1459075097,"lastPoster":"Doo Doo","replies":12,"views":2764,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":-3},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":45468,"threadID":3460,"userID":2147,"username":"Doo Doo","subject":"Recording the Range","time":1459002407,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1998,"username":"aXaX.","time":1459012370,"value":1},{"userID":2068,"username":"Fiddles","time":1459031443,"value":1},{"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","time":1459080771,"value":1},{"userID":1447,"username":"iSh00ter","time":1459003061,"value":-1},{"userID":1903,"username":"dopi","time":1459005891,"value":-1},{"userID":1831,"username":"Strupino","time":1459015204,"value":-1},{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1459027210,"value":-1},{"userID":1602,"username":"FABI / RIZAY","time":1459069023,"value":-1},{"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","time":1459076742,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hey! So, I saw on other servers that you could see the range of when you kill someone. I was thinking that you could add that to the Dream knife server? I mean, it could benefit a lot of people if they want to take knifing seriously and practice their max range and also it could be useful to spot hackers if they are always knifing at the perfect range.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Thanks! :&#x27;D</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":45473,"threadID":3460,"userID":1998,"username":"aXaX.","subject":"","time":1459012367,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Why do u dislike this post?<br>I think is a good idea !</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>+1 KingAndrewDoo</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":45474,"threadID":3460,"userID":2147,"username":"Doo Doo","subject":"","time":1459012564,"lastEdi